   "kind": "state",
   "city": "Ranchi",
   "lat": 23.3441,
   "lng": 85.3096,
   "catalog": "WOS-041",
   "role": "The Jharkhand government's tribal research institute commissioned Akhra's festival films Karam and Sohrai and Biju Toppo's Tapu Rajee, holds screenings in its hall in Ranchi, and in 2025 began the Dharti Aaba Tribal Film Festival."
  },
  {
