   "kind": "corporate",
   "city": "Jamshedpur",
   "lat": 22.8046,
   "lng": 86.2029,
   "catalog": "WOS-095",
   "role": "The company's foundation co-produced the animated Mundari Srishtikatha, runs Samvaad, its annual tribal conclave, and since 2015 the Samuday Ke Saath film programme, which screened Naachi Se Baanchi at IIM Ranchi in 2023. Tapu Rajee was shown in Jamshedpur at Tata's invitation."
  },
  {
   "key": "pradan",
